  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "王淦昌消失的那十七年家里发生了一件事儿，每次想起来都让人喘不过气。有一回他的妻子重病住院，生死未卜，家里人急疯了，连发了好几封加急电报，催他赶紧回去。可那几天正赶上原子弹试验最要命的最后攻坚期，电报送到他手上的时候，他正在实验室里连把那封电报死死攥在手里。揉得皱巴巴的最后颤抖着揣进了怀里，转身又一头扎进了实验数据。那天晚上，有人在戈壁滩上看到他一个人坐在沙丘上，手里捏着那封电报，直勾勾的望着北京的方向，像一尊石像，一动不动，坐了整整两个小时。您想想那个画面漫天风沙，一个五十多岁的老人坐在沙丘上，手里攥着妻子病危的电报，望着家的方向，他不能回去，他回不去。因为他手里攥着的不只是一个家的命，还有整个国家的命。后来试验成功了，他发疯似的赶回家。妻子刚出院不久，当妻子抬起头，看着面前这个晒的黢黑满脸深深的皱纹，头发白了大半的陌生男人时，半天没说出话，眼泪却像断了线的珠子一样，先掉了下来整整十七年了，他不知道他在哪不知道他在干什么，甚至不知道他是不是还活着。您说这十七年他是怎么熬过来的？在戈壁滩的那些年，王淦昌是技术总负责人，按说他完全可以坐在后方指挥，用不着去现场拼命。可他偏不戈壁滩，漫天风沙，大家永远能看到他蹲在地上，跟年轻人一起趴着调试设备，饿了就啃口，干粮，困了就靠在土墙上打个盹。身边人劝他，您都这把年纪了，总这么熬也不是个事儿啊，歇一歇吧，他急得直摆手，这是国家的命脉，差一丝一毫都不行，哪怕熬断骨头，我也得亲自盯着。从一九六一年到一九六四年，他指导了上千次爆轰事宴第一颗原子弹的，每一个核心部件都经过了他的手，一个一个检测过来的。一九六四年十月十六日，罗布泊内一声惊天巨响，巨大的蘑菇云腾空升起，震惊了全世界。在所有欢呼雀跃、相拥而泣的人群里，他只能默默站在角落，看着漫天火光，双手控制不住的剧烈颤抖，没人知道这个戴着眼镜皮肤粗糙的老头，就是当年名震海外的物理学天才。没人知道，为了这一声巨响，他放弃了什么，亏欠了什么，又忍受了什么。三年后，中国的第一颗氢弹爆炸成功，从原子弹到氢弹，咱们只用了两年零八个月，全世界研制速度最快的国家，至今还一直保持着这个让世界胆寒的奇迹背后，是他和无数中国科研人员拿命熬出来的这十七年。从五十四岁到七十一岁，他把一个科学家最宝贵的年华全部埋进了戈壁黄沙里。一九七八年，他终于恢复了本名回到了北京。这时候的他已经是一个七十一岁的老人了。后来有人问他，放弃了所有的荣誉和光环，你感觉亏不亏后不后悔。他笑的云淡风轻，说了一句话，能让咱们国家不再受人欺负。别说十七年搭上一辈子，嗯，晚年的他住在简陋的老房子里，嗯，国家发的奖金他一分不留，全捐给了科研事业和贫困学生，一件破旧的中山装穿了十几年。一九九八年，这位老人走了，享年九十一岁。家里没有一件像样的家具，只留下了满满一屋子的科研资料。九个月后，国家追授他两弹一星功勋奖章。可是他已经看不到了，各位老朋友王老走了，但他的故事不该就这么结束。您想想，他的妻子等了他十七年，他的女儿十几年没有父亲，可在中国，像这样的家庭，又何止他一个邓稼先的妻子？许露西在丈夫消失后，一个人拉扯两个孩子，等了整整二十八年。郭永怀飞机失世用，身体互助绝密资料牺牲时才五十九岁前三强，被称为中国原子弹之父，却在最艰难的岁月里被下放到农村，他们每一个人都把家字放在了国字后面。这些人的故事不该只活在档案里。他以我想给大伙推荐这套国之脊梁，他是环球人物杂志社主编的，里面收录了三十多位科学界功勋人物的真实人生。从两弹一星到航天农业，从钱学森到袁隆平，一个比一个让人戳心。书里有大量珍贵的历史老照片，还有院士们的亲笔语录，不是那种干巴巴的人物传记。您翻开看两页，就知道什么叫把一生交给国家的人自己读是一份敬意。给孩子读是一种传承，让咱们的孩子知道今天的好日子不是天上掉下来，是有人拿命换的书。就在视频左下角感兴趣的朋友带回去，点个赞，收藏起来，评论区留一句，王老，我们记住您了，再转发给身边的老朋友，关注我，下一期继续讲那些把名字藏进黄沙里的国之脊梁。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 5010,
      "text": "王淦昌消失的那十七年家里发生了一件事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5010,
      "end_ms": 8510,
      "text": "每次想起来都让人喘不过气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00003",
      "start_ms": 8510,
      "end_ms": 11590,
      "text": "有一回他的妻子重病住院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00004",
      "start_ms": 11730,
      "end_ms": 12590,
      "text": "生死未卜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00005",
      "start_ms": 12970,
      "end_ms": 14250,
      "text": "家里人急疯了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00006",
      "start_ms": 14630,
      "end_ms": 16770,
      "text": "连发了好几封加急电报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00007",
      "start_ms": 17110,
      "end_ms": 18390,
      "text": "催他赶紧回去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00008",
      "start_ms": 18970,
      "end_ms": 24010,
      "text": "可那几天正赶上原子弹试验最要命的最后攻坚期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00009",
      "start_ms": 24590,
      "end_ms": 26410,
      "text": "电报送到他手上的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00010",
      "start_ms": 26590,
      "end_ms": 31780,
      "text": "他正在实验室里连把那封电报死死攥在手里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00011",
      "start_ms": 32060,
      "end_ms": 36980,
      "text": "揉得皱巴巴的最后颤抖着揣进了怀里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00012",
      "start_ms": 36980,
      "end_ms": 40100,
      "text": "转身又一头扎进了实验数据。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00013",
      "start_ms": 40700,
      "end_ms": 41480,
      "text": "那天晚上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00014",
      "start_ms": 41800,
      "end_ms": 45540,
      "text": "有人在戈壁滩上看到他一个人坐在沙丘上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00015",
      "start_ms": 45880,
      "end_ms": 47520,
      "text": "手里捏着那封电报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00016",
      "start_ms": 48000,
      "end_ms": 50580,
      "text": "直勾勾的望着北京的方向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00017",
      "start_ms": 51060,
      "end_ms": 52540,
      "text": "像一尊石像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00018",
      "start_ms": 53040,
      "end_ms": 53920,
      "text": "一动不动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00019",
      "start_ms": 54340,
      "end_ms": 56140,
      "text": "坐了整整两个小时。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00020",
      "start_ms": 56620,
      "end_ms": 59500,
      "text": "您想想那个画面漫天风沙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00021",
      "start_ms": 60230,
      "end_ms": 63635,
      "text": "一个五十多岁的老人坐在沙丘上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00022",
      "start_ms": 64020,
      "end_ms": 66435,
      "text": "手里攥着妻子病危的电报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00023",
      "start_ms": 67040,
      "end_ms": 68400,
      "text": "望着家的方向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00024",
      "start_ms": 68520,
      "end_ms": 69705,
      "text": "他不能回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00025",
      "start_ms": 70340,
      "end_ms": 71275,
      "text": "他回不去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00026",
      "start_ms": 71770,
      "end_ms": 74835,
      "text": "因为他手里攥着的不只是一个家的命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00027",
      "start_ms": 75120,
      "end_ms": 76915,
      "text": "还有整个国家的命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00028",
      "start_ms": 77470,
      "end_ms": 78925,
      "text": "后来试验成功了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00029",
      "start_ms": 79310,
      "end_ms": 80905,
      "text": "他发疯似的赶回家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00030",
      "start_ms": 81410,
      "end_ms": 82805,
      "text": "妻子刚出院不久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00031",
      "start_ms": 83180,
      "end_ms": 84505,
      "text": "当妻子抬起头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00032",
      "start_ms": 85020,
      "end_ms": 89575,
      "text": "看着面前这个晒的黢黑满脸深深的皱纹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00033",
      "start_ms": 89940,
      "end_ms": 92885,
      "text": "头发白了大半的陌生男人时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00034",
      "start_ms": 93370,
      "end_ms": 94690,
      "text": "半天没说出话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00035",
      "start_ms": 95010,
      "end_ms": 98010,
      "text": "眼泪却像断了线的珠子一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00036",
      "start_ms": 98110,
      "end_ms": 101115,
      "text": "先掉了下来整整十七年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00037",
      "start_ms": 101700,
      "end_ms": 104455,
      "text": "他不知道他在哪不知道他在干什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00038",
      "start_ms": 104760,
      "end_ms": 107020,
      "text": "甚至不知道他是不是还活着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00039",
      "start_ms": 107120,
      "end_ms": 110665,
      "text": "您说这十七年他是怎么熬过来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00040",
      "start_ms": 111690,
      "end_ms": 113230,
      "text": "在戈壁滩的那些年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00041",
      "start_ms": 113470,
      "end_ms": 115825,
      "text": "王淦昌是技术总负责人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00042",
      "start_ms": 116420,
      "end_ms": 119365,
      "text": "按说他完全可以坐在后方指挥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00043",
      "start_ms": 119820,
      "end_ms": 121365,
      "text": "用不着去现场拼命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00044",
      "start_ms": 122120,
      "end_ms": 124330,
      "text": "可他偏不戈壁滩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00045",
      "start_ms": 124370,
      "end_ms": 125410,
      "text": "漫天风沙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00046",
      "start_ms": 125630,
      "end_ms": 127890,
      "text": "大家永远能看到他蹲在地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00047",
      "start_ms": 128170,
      "end_ms": 130745,
      "text": "跟年轻人一起趴着调试设备，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00048",
      "start_ms": 131120,
      "end_ms": 132400,
      "text": "饿了就啃口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00049",
      "start_ms": 132400,
      "end_ms": 132805,
      "text": "干粮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00050",
      "start_ms": 133120,
      "end_ms": 135675,
      "text": "困了就靠在土墙上打个盹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00051",
      "start_ms": 136260,
      "end_ms": 137260,
      "text": "身边人劝他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00052",
      "start_ms": 137420,
      "end_ms": 138805,
      "text": "您都这把年纪了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00053",
      "start_ms": 139130,
      "end_ms": 141330,
      "text": "总这么熬也不是个事儿啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00054",
      "start_ms": 141330,
      "end_ms": 142145,
      "text": "歇一歇吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00055",
      "start_ms": 143280,
      "end_ms": 144425,
      "text": "他急得直摆手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00056",
      "start_ms": 145310,
      "end_ms": 146655,
      "text": "这是国家的命脉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00057",
      "start_ms": 147430,
      "end_ms": 149235,
      "text": "差一丝一毫都不行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00058",
      "start_ms": 150110,
      "end_ms": 151565,
      "text": "哪怕熬断骨头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00059",
      "start_ms": 152210,
      "end_ms": 153745,
      "text": "我也得亲自盯着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00060",
      "start_ms": 155020,
      "end_ms": 158295,
      "text": "从一九六一年到一九六四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00061",
      "start_ms": 158810,
      "end_ms": 164730,
      "text": "他指导了上千次爆轰事宴第一颗原子弹的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00062",
      "start_ms": 164730,
      "end_ms": 168075,
      "text": "每一个核心部件都经过了他的手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00063",
      "start_ms": 168400,
      "end_ms": 170545,
      "text": "一个一个检测过来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00064",
      "start_ms": 172270,
      "end_ms": 174245,
      "text": "一九六四年十月十六日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00065",
      "start_ms": 174500,
      "end_ms": 177365,
      "text": "罗布泊内一声惊天巨响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00066",
      "start_ms": 177760,
      "end_ms": 180535,
      "text": "巨大的蘑菇云腾空升起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00067",
      "start_ms": 180970,
      "end_ms": 182550,
      "text": "震惊了全世界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00068",
      "start_ms": 182690,
      "end_ms": 187075,
      "text": "在所有欢呼雀跃、相拥而泣的人群里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00069",
      "start_ms": 187480,
      "end_ms": 189675,
      "text": "他只能默默站在角落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00070",
      "start_ms": 190050,
      "end_ms": 191615,
      "text": "看着漫天火光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00071",
      "start_ms": 192140,
      "end_ms": 194555,
      "text": "双手控制不住的剧烈颤抖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00072",
      "start_ms": 194920,
      "end_ms": 199325,
      "text": "没人知道这个戴着眼镜皮肤粗糙的老头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00073",
      "start_ms": 199680,
      "end_ms": 202685,
      "text": "就是当年名震海外的物理学天才。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00074",
      "start_ms": 203410,
      "end_ms": 204245,
      "text": "没人知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00075",
      "start_ms": 204640,
      "end_ms": 206095,
      "text": "为了这一声巨响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00076",
      "start_ms": 206430,
      "end_ms": 207590,
      "text": "他放弃了什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00077",
      "start_ms": 207770,
      "end_ms": 208830,
      "text": "亏欠了什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00078",
      "start_ms": 209030,
      "end_ms": 210390,
      "text": "又忍受了什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00079",
      "start_ms": 210730,
      "end_ms": 211450,
      "text": "三年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00080",
      "start_ms": 211710,
      "end_ms": 214215,
      "text": "中国的第一颗氢弹爆炸成功，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00081",
      "start_ms": 214770,
      "end_ms": 216175,
      "text": "从原子弹到氢弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00082",
      "start_ms": 216490,
      "end_ms": 218710,
      "text": "咱们只用了两年零八个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00083",
      "start_ms": 218790,
      "end_ms": 221155,
      "text": "全世界研制速度最快的国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00084",
      "start_ms": 221520,
      "end_ms": 227575,
      "text": "至今还一直保持着这个让世界胆寒的奇迹背后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00085",
      "start_ms": 227950,
      "end_ms": 233360,
      "text": "是他和无数中国科研人员拿命熬出来的这十七年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00086",
      "start_ms": 233640,
      "end_ms": 236325,
      "text": "从五十四岁到七十一岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00087",
      "start_ms": 237130,
      "end_ms": 242345,
      "text": "他把一个科学家最宝贵的年华全部埋进了戈壁黄沙里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00088",
      "start_ms": 243230,
      "end_ms": 244230,
      "text": "一九七八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00089",
      "start_ms": 244430,
      "end_ms": 248175,
      "text": "他终于恢复了本名回到了北京。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00090",
      "start_ms": 249130,
      "end_ms": 253295,
      "text": "这时候的他已经是一个七十一岁的老人了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00091",
      "start_ms": 254380,
      "end_ms": 255575,
      "text": "后来有人问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00092",
      "start_ms": 255920,
      "end_ms": 258380,
      "text": "放弃了所有的荣誉和光环，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00093",
      "start_ms": 258480,
      "end_ms": 261215,
      "text": "你感觉亏不亏后不后悔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00094",
      "start_ms": 262140,
      "end_ms": 263640,
      "text": "他笑的云淡风轻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00095",
      "start_ms": 264020,
      "end_ms": 264995,
      "text": "说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00096",
      "start_ms": 265850,
      "end_ms": 268645,
      "text": "能让咱们国家不再受人欺负。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00097",
      "start_ms": 269370,
      "end_ms": 272175,
      "text": "别说十七年搭上一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00098",
      "start_ms": 273970,
      "end_ms": 274210,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00099",
      "start_ms": 275160,
      "end_ms": 278145,
      "text": "晚年的他住在简陋的老房子里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00100",
      "start_ms": 278420,
      "end_ms": 278685,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00101",
      "start_ms": 278930,
      "end_ms": 281245,
      "text": "国家发的奖金他一分不留，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00102",
      "start_ms": 281730,
      "end_ms": 284345,
      "text": "全捐给了科研事业和贫困学生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00103",
      "start_ms": 284970,
      "end_ms": 288135,
      "text": "一件破旧的中山装穿了十几年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00104",
      "start_ms": 288730,
      "end_ms": 289595,
      "text": "一九九八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00105",
      "start_ms": 290650,
      "end_ms": 291835,
      "text": "这位老人走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00106",
      "start_ms": 292590,
      "end_ms": 294155,
      "text": "享年九十一岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00107",
      "start_ms": 295030,
      "end_ms": 297450,
      "text": "家里没有一件像样的家具，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00108",
      "start_ms": 297530,
      "end_ms": 300650,
      "text": "只留下了满满一屋子的科研资料。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00109",
      "start_ms": 301550,
      "end_ms": 302625,
      "text": "九个月后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00110",
      "start_ms": 303130,
      "end_ms": 306985,
      "text": "国家追授他两弹一星功勋奖章。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00111",
      "start_ms": 307900,
      "end_ms": 310020,
      "text": "可是他已经看不到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00112",
      "start_ms": 311500,
      "end_ms": 315280,
      "text": "各位老朋友王老走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00113",
      "start_ms": 315640,
      "end_ms": 318200,
      "text": "但他的故事不该就这么结束。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00114",
      "start_ms": 318740,
      "end_ms": 319460,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00115",
      "start_ms": 320000,
      "end_ms": 322279,
      "text": "他的妻子等了他十七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00116",
      "start_ms": 322680,
      "end_ms": 325560,
      "text": "他的女儿十几年没有父亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00117",
      "start_ms": 326520,
      "end_ms": 327420,
      "text": "可在中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00118",
      "start_ms": 327800,
      "end_ms": 329160,
      "text": "像这样的家庭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00119",
      "start_ms": 329580,
      "end_ms": 332460,
      "text": "又何止他一个邓稼先的妻子？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00120",
      "start_ms": 332460,
      "end_ms": 334720,
      "text": "许露西在丈夫消失后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00121",
      "start_ms": 334840,
      "end_ms": 336460,
      "text": "一个人拉扯两个孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00122",
      "start_ms": 336540,
      "end_ms": 338180,
      "text": "等了整整二十八年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00123",
      "start_ms": 338580,
      "end_ms": 341000,
      "text": "郭永怀飞机失世用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00124",
      "start_ms": 341060,
      "end_ms": 346350,
      "text": "身体互助绝密资料牺牲时才五十九岁前三强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00125",
      "start_ms": 346430,
      "end_ms": 348570,
      "text": "被称为中国原子弹之父，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00126",
      "start_ms": 349230,
      "end_ms": 352870,
      "text": "却在最艰难的岁月里被下放到农村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00127",
      "start_ms": 353470,
      "end_ms": 357530,
      "text": "他们每一个人都把家字放在了国字后面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00128",
      "start_ms": 358070,
      "end_ms": 361010,
      "text": "这些人的故事不该只活在档案里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00129",
      "start_ms": 361730,
      "end_ms": 364350,
      "text": "他以我想给大伙推荐这套国之脊梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00130",
      "start_ms": 365070,
      "end_ms": 367705,
      "text": "他是环球人物杂志社主编的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00131",
      "start_ms": 368270,
      "end_ms": 373950,
      "text": "里面收录了三十多位科学界功勋人物的真实人生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00132",
      "start_ms": 374030,
      "end_ms": 376755,
      "text": "从两弹一星到航天农业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00133",
      "start_ms": 377190,
      "end_ms": 379215,
      "text": "从钱学森到袁隆平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00134",
      "start_ms": 379720,
      "end_ms": 381845,
      "text": "一个比一个让人戳心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00135",
      "start_ms": 382630,
      "end_ms": 385130,
      "text": "书里有大量珍贵的历史老照片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00136",
      "start_ms": 385410,
      "end_ms": 387775,
      "text": "还有院士们的亲笔语录，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00137",
      "start_ms": 388280,
      "end_ms": 390525,
      "text": "不是那种干巴巴的人物传记。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00138",
      "start_ms": 390960,
      "end_ms": 392375,
      "text": "您翻开看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00139",
      "start_ms": 392660,
      "end_ms": 398150,
      "text": "就知道什么叫把一生交给国家的人自己读是一份敬意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00140",
      "start_ms": 398450,
      "end_ms": 400775,
      "text": "给孩子读是一种传承，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00141",
      "start_ms": 401320,
      "end_ms": 405595,
      "text": "让咱们的孩子知道今天的好日子不是天上掉下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00142",
      "start_ms": 405990,
      "end_ms": 407950,
      "text": "是有人拿命换的书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00143",
      "start_ms": 408030,
      "end_ms": 411290,
      "text": "就在视频左下角感兴趣的朋友带回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00144",
      "start_ms": 411470,
      "end_ms": 412155,
      "text": "点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00145",
      "start_ms": 412470,
      "end_ms": 413325,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00146",
      "start_ms": 413630,
      "end_ms": 414715,
      "text": "评论区留一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00147",
      "start_ms": 414990,
      "end_ms": 415435,
      "text": "王老，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00148",
      "start_ms": 415740,
      "end_ms": 416760,
      "text": "我们记住您了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00149",
      "start_ms": 417020,
      "end_ms": 419395,
      "text": "再转发给身边的老朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00150",
      "start_ms": 419870,
      "end_ms": 420515,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3cc58547e4d20c73_s00151",
      "start_ms": 420950,
      "end_ms": 426565,
      "text": "下一期继续讲那些把名字藏进黄沙里的国之脊梁。"
    }
  ],
